    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rea McGee are delighted to bring this prominent industrial unit in Cookstown, Tallaght.\r\n\r\nThe two storey unit is 142m2 in size and would suit many occupiers. Accommodation comprises of mezzanine, warhouse space, 2 offices, kitchenette and wc facilities. \r\n\r\nThis high profile unit is superbly located in the centre of Tallaght. The property is within minutes of an excellent range of cafés, restaurants and shops, while also benefiting from convenient access to the N7 & M50. The Red Line Luas is within walking distance. The Square Town Cente & Tallaght Village are within close proximity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "€2700 Rates\r\n€1300 Management Fees\r\n4 Designated Car Spaces\r\nRoller Shutter\r\nFully Alarmed\r\nElectric Heating\r\nGated & Secure Development"
